msgid "%d agent session(s) are running and will be left as they are."
msgstr "%d 个智能体会话正在运行，将保持原状。"

msgid ""
"A file named 00-fcc-local-forwarding.conf on the LAN machine does not belong "
"to FCC and was left as it is."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机上有一个 00-fcc-local-forwarding.conf，它不是 FCC 创建的，已保持原"
"样。"

msgid ""
"A file named 00-fcc-local-forwarding.conf was already on the LAN machine and "
"was left as it is. The Admin tunnel needs AllowTcpForwarding local in that "
"machine’s SSH configuration."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机上原本就有一个 00-fcc-local-forwarding.conf，已保持原样。FCC Admin "
"隧道需要在该主机的 SSH 配置中设置 AllowTcpForwarding local。"

msgid ""
"A job is still running. Wait for it to finish before clearing the record."
msgstr "任务仍在运行，请等它结束后再清除记录。"

msgid "A new SSH key was generated."
msgstr "已生成新的 SSH 密钥。"

msgid ""
"A private IPv4 address. Hostnames are not accepted: a name can resolve to a "
"WAN address."
msgstr "私有 IPv4 地址。不接受主机名：主机名可能解析为 WAN 地址。"

msgid "A temporary directory could not be created on this router."
msgstr "无法在本机创建临时目录。"

msgid ""
"Add this key to the account's authorized_keys file, then test the connection "
"again."
msgstr "将此密钥加入该账号的 authorized_keys 文件，然后重新测试连接。"

msgid ""
"Address the FCC server listens on. The FCC Admin page is served through "
"LuCI, which reaches the server on 127.0.0.1, so keep that unless another "
"device must reach the FCC API directly. Only 0.0.0.0 exposes the server to "
"the LAN, and it adds a LAN-only firewall rule; the port is never opened to "
"the WAN. Any other address is narrowed to 127.0.0.1, because the Admin page "
"cannot be reached through one."
msgstr ""
"FCC 服务器监听的地址。FCC Admin 页面通过 LuCI 提供，LuCI 会以 127.0.0.1 访问"
"服务器，因此除非有其他设备需要直接访问 FCC API，否则请保持该值。只有 0.0.0.0 "
"会把服务器暴露到局域网，并会添加一条仅限局域网的防火墙规则；该端口绝不会对 "
"WAN 开放。其他任何地址都会被收窄为 127.0.0.1，因为无法通过这类地址打开 Admin "
"页面。"

msgid "Admin port"
msgstr "Admin 端口"

msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

msgid "Agent"
msgstr "智能体"

msgid "Agent [LAN]"
msgstr "智能体[局域网]"

msgid "Agent [This router]"
msgstr "智能体[本机]"

msgid "Agent exited unexpectedly."
msgstr "智能体意外退出。"

msgid "Agent list unavailable"
msgstr "智能体列表不可用"

msgid "Agents"
msgstr "智能体"

msgid "All agents"
msgstr "全部智能体"

msgid "All unsaved terminal state will be lost."
msgstr "所有未保存的终端状态都将丢失。"

msgid ""
"An interactive terminal running a coding agent. Sessions keep running after "
"you close this page, and reattaching to one restores its screen."
msgstr ""
"运行智能体的交互式终端。关闭本页面后会话仍会继续运行，重新连接即可恢复会话记"
"录。"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

msgid "Are you sure you want to close this session?"
msgstr "确定要关闭此会话吗？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to end all sessions?"
msgstr "确定要结束全部会话吗？"

msgid "Backup path"
msgstr "备份路径"

msgid ""
"Base directory for the FCC runtime. The runtime is placed in a “fcc” "
"subdirectory, so /opt gives /opt/fcc. Changing this does not move an "
"existing installation."
msgstr ""
"FCC 的基础目录。运行时会放在其下的“fcc”子目录中，因此 /opt 对应 /opt/fcc。修"
"改此项不会移动已安装的文件。"

msgid "Basic Information"
msgstr "基本信息"

msgid "Bind address"
msgstr "绑定地址"

# The key names its context on purpose — do not shorten it back to "CPU".
# LuCI resolves a key by hash against every *.zh-cn.lmo installed on the device
# and takes the first catalogue that has it; a .lmo stores no msgid, so it
# cannot tell our entry from another package's. A bare "CPU" is a key that
# luci-app-openclash and others claim for their own rows, so this card was
# titled from whichever catalogue lmo_translate() reached first. "CPU Info" is
# claimed by nothing else, so the label is ours. "Translating" the key to
# itself is no escape either: po2lmo writes no index entry when the msgstr
# hashes to the msgid, which drops the key outright.
msgid "CPU Info"
msgstr "处理器信息"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Changes discarded. The saved settings are shown."
msgstr "已放弃未保存的更改，当前显示的是已保存的设置。"

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

msgid "Checking the LAN FCC Server state..."
msgstr "正在检查局域网的 FCC Server 状态…"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在检查…"

msgid "Clear check log"
msgstr "清空检查日志"

msgid "Clear information"
msgstr "清空信息"

