msgid "On the LAN side the agent itself runs on the other machine, over SSH."
msgstr "局域网模式下，智能体本身通过 SSH 在另一台机器上运行。"

msgid "One-time authorization"
msgstr "一次性授权"

msgid ""
"Only an administrator on the LAN machine may control its FCC Server. Start "
"it on that machine itself, or give this account the right to control the "
"service."
msgstr ""
"只有局域网主机的管理员才能控制它的 FCC Server。请在该主机上直接启动，或授予此"
"账户控制该服务的权限。"

msgid ""
"Only an administrator on the LAN machine may control its FCC Server. Start "
"it on that machine itself."
msgstr "只有局域网主机的管理员才能控制它的 FCC Server。请在该主机上直接启动。"

msgid ""
"Only needed when the LAN machine's SSH server refuses local forwarding. "
"Paste this block into a shell on that machine, as an administrator: it "
"installs one small program and the sudoers rule that lets this router set, "
"and take away, the single sshd setting the Admin tunnel needs."
msgstr ""
"只有在局域网主机的 SSH 服务拒绝本地转发时才需要。请以管理员身份把下面这段内容"
"粘贴到那台主机的终端里：它会安装一个小程序，以及一条 sudoers 规则，让这台路由"
"器能够设置和撤销 Admin 隧道所需的那一项 sshd 设置。"

msgid ""
"Only one FCC Server runs at a time. Switching to a side stops the other one."
msgstr "同一时间只运行一个 FCC Server。切换到另一侧时会停止原来那一侧的服务。"

