msgstr "终端连接已断开，正在重新连接…"

msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

msgid "That agent is not one this package knows."
msgstr "该智能体不在本软件包已知的列表中。"

msgid ""
"The FCC Server did not start on the LAN machine. Its log there says why: "
"~/.fcc/server.log when the upstream install started it, or logs/fcc-"
"server.log under the install path when the init script this package installs "
"started it."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机上的 FCC Server 未能启动。那台机器上的日志会说明原因：由上游安装启动"
"时看 ~/.fcc/server.log，由本包安装的 init 脚本启动时看安装路径下的 "
"logs/fcc-server.log。"

msgid ""
"The FCC Server did not stop on the LAN machine. Its process is still running "
"there."
msgstr "局域网主机上的 FCC Server 未能停止，它的进程仍在该主机上运行。"

msgid ""
"The FCC Server is not installed on the LAN machine. Install it there, then "
"try again."
msgstr "局域网主机上未安装 FCC Server。请先在那台主机上安装，然后再试。"

msgid ""
"The FCC Server on the LAN machine is not running. Start it on the "
"Configuration tab."
msgstr "局域网主机上的 FCC Server 未运行。请在“配置管理”标签页启动它。"

msgid "The LAN FCC Server is not running."
msgstr "局域网的 FCC Server 未运行。"

msgid "The LAN FCC Server is running."
msgstr "局域网的 FCC Server 正在运行。"

msgid "The LAN FCC Server state could not be checked"
msgstr "无法检查局域网的 FCC Server 状态"

msgid ""
"The LAN access rule was removed; the port is no longer opened by this app."
msgstr "局域网访问规则已移除；本应用不再开放该端口。"

msgid "The LAN connection settings are incomplete."
msgstr "局域网连接设置不完整。"

msgid "The LAN connection settings could not be saved."
msgstr "局域网连接设置无法保存。"

msgid "The LAN connection state could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取局域网连接状态。"

msgid "The LAN machine answered in a form that could not be read."
msgstr "局域网主机的应答无法解析。"

msgid "The LAN machine answered with something unexpected."
msgstr "局域网主机返回了无法识别的内容。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine could not be reached over SSH. Check that it is switched on "
"and that its SSH server is running."
msgstr "无法通过 SSH 连接到局域网主机。请确认它已开机，并且 SSH 服务正在运行。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine could not be reached. Check that it is on and that SSH is "
"enabled."
msgstr "无法连接到局域网主机。请确认它已开机，并且已启用 SSH。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine does not run luci-app-fcc, so its agents cannot be listed."
msgstr "局域网主机没有运行 luci-app-fcc，因此无法列出它的智能体。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine has no fcc service and no launcher to start. Install the FCC "
"Server on that machine, or check the service name in Advanced settings."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机既没有 fcc 服务，也没有可启动的启动器。请在那台主机上安装 FCC "
"Server，或在“高级配置”中检查服务名称。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine has no pgrep, so its FCC Server cannot be found to be "
"started or stopped from here."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机上没有 pgrep，因此无法从这里找到并启动或停止它的 FCC Server。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine has no systemctl. If it runs OpenWrt, set its platform to "
"OpenWrt in Advanced settings."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机没有 systemctl。如果它运行的是 OpenWrt，请在高级设置中把平台设为 "
"OpenWrt。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine is not configured yet. Set it up in Configuration → FCC "
"Server."
msgstr "局域网主机尚未配置。请在“配置管理 → FCC Server”中完成设置。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine refused the SSH key. Add the public key from Configuration → "
"FCC Server to that account’s authorized_keys."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机拒绝了该 SSH 密钥。请把“配置管理 → FCC Server”中的公钥添加到该账户"
"的 authorized_keys 中。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine refused the SSH key. Add the public key shown here to that "
"account’s authorized_keys."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机拒绝了该 SSH 密钥。请把此处显示的公钥添加到该账户的 "
"authorized_keys 中。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine’s SSH daemon may still refuse the Admin tunnel: this account "
"is not allowed to change its configuration. AllowTcpForwarding local has to "
"be set there by an administrator — “One-time authorization” above has the "
"command."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机的 SSH 服务可能仍会拒绝 FCC Admin 隧道：本账户无权修改它的配置，需"
"要由管理员在那里设置 AllowTcpForwarding local —— 上方「一次性授权」给出了具体"
"命令。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine’s SSH daemon rejected the forwarding setting, so it was "
"taken away again. The Admin tunnel needs AllowTcpForwarding local in that "
"machine’s SSH configuration."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机的 SSH 服务拒绝了这项转发设置，因此已将其移除。FCC Admin 隧道需要在"
"该主机的 SSH 配置中设置 AllowTcpForwarding local。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine’s SSH service did not reload, so the change to its "
"forwarding setting has not taken effect."
msgstr "局域网主机的 SSH 服务没有重新加载，因此对转发设置的修改尚未生效。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine’s host key has not been trusted yet. Trust it in "
"Configuration → FCC Server."
msgstr "尚未信任局域网主机的主机密钥。请在“配置管理 → FCC Server”中信任它。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine’s host key no longer matches the one pinned on this router. "
"Forget it and trust it again in Configuration → FCC Server."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机的主机密钥与本机固定的那一个不再一致。请在“配置管理 → FCC Server”中"
"忘记它并重新信任。"

msgid ""
"The LAN machine’s host key no longer matches the one pinned on this router. "
"Forget the pinned key and trust it again."
msgstr ""
"局域网主机的主机密钥与本机固定的那一个不再一致。请忘记已固定的密钥后重新信"
"任。"

msgid "The LAN machine’s state could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取局域网主机的状态。"

msgid "The LAN side is not the selected FCC Server."
msgstr "当前选择的 FCC Server 不是局域网。"

msgid ""
"The LuCI app version could not be checked — the router could not reach the "
"version source."
msgstr "无法检查 LuCI 应用版本 —— 路由器无法访问版本源。"

msgid "The SSH key could not be created."
msgstr "无法创建 SSH 密钥。"

msgid "The SSH key could not be generated."
msgstr "无法生成 SSH 密钥。"

msgid "The SSH key has not been generated yet."
msgstr "尚未生成 SSH 密钥。"

msgid ""
"The SSH key on this router cannot be used by OpenSSH. Generate the key again."
msgstr "本机的 SSH 密钥无法被 OpenSSH 使用。请重新生成密钥。"

msgid ""
"The SSH key on this router is missing. Generate it again in Configuration → "
"FCC Server, then add the new public key to the LAN machine."
msgstr ""
"本机的 SSH 密钥缺失。请在“配置管理 → FCC Server”中重新生成，然后把新的公钥添"
"加到局域网主机。"

msgid ""
"The SSH key on this router is missing. Generate the key again, then add the "
"new public key to the LAN machine."
msgstr "本机的 SSH 密钥缺失。请重新生成密钥，然后把新的公钥添加到局域网主机。"

msgid ""
"The SSH key on this router is not a key OpenSSH can read. Generate the key "
"again, then add the new public key to the LAN machine."
msgstr ""
"本机的 SSH 密钥不是 OpenSSH 能读取的密钥。请重新生成密钥，然后把新的公钥添加"
"到局域网主机。"

msgid ""
"The SSH key on this router is not one OpenSSH can read. Generate it again in "
"Configuration → FCC Server, then add the new public key to the LAN machine."
msgstr ""
"本机的 SSH 密钥不是 OpenSSH 能读取的密钥。请在“配置管理 → FCC Server”中重新生"
"成，然后把新的公钥添加到局域网主机。"

msgid "The address or SSH port changed — the pinned host key was forgotten."
msgstr "地址或 SSH 端口已更改——已忘记固定的主机密钥。"

msgid "The browser blocked the new window."
msgstr "浏览器阻止了新窗口。"

msgid "The connection failed."
msgstr "连接失败。"

msgid "The existing SSH key could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取现有的 SSH 密钥。"

msgid "The existing key is shown below."
msgstr "现有密钥显示在下方。"

msgid ""
"The firewall rule could not be added — the server is bound to every "
"interface without one."
msgstr "无法添加防火墙规则——服务器已绑定到所有网络接口，但没有相应规则。"

msgid ""
"The forwarding file could not be removed from the LAN machine: this account "
"is not allowed to change its SSH configuration. It was left in place."
msgstr ""
"无法从局域网主机删除该转发配置文件：本账户无权修改它的 SSH 配置，文件已保持原"
"样。"

msgid "The host key could not be trusted."
msgstr "无法信任该主机密钥。"

msgid "The host key fingerprint is not valid."
msgstr "主机密钥指纹无效。"

msgid ""
"The install path changed — install the runtime at the new location to use it."
msgstr "安装路径已更改 —— 请在新位置安装运行时后再使用。"

msgid "The installer will add the missing packages before it starts:"
msgstr "安装程序会先自动安装缺失的依赖包："

msgid "The mode could not be switched."
msgstr "无法切换模式。"

msgid "The one-time setup has not been installed on the LAN machine yet."
msgstr "局域网主机上还没有安装一次性准备。"

msgid "The one-time setup is already in place on the LAN machine."
msgstr "局域网主机上的一次性准备已就位。"

msgid "The operation failed."
msgstr "操作失败。"

msgid "The pinned host key could not be forgotten."
msgstr "无法忘记已固定的主机密钥。"

msgid "The pinned host key was forgotten."
msgstr "已忘记固定的主机密钥。"

msgid "The platform selected for the LAN machine is not valid."
msgstr "为局域网主机选择的平台无效。"

msgid "The public key could not be stored on this router."
msgstr "无法在本机保存公钥。"

msgid ""
"The public key does not belong to the private key on this router. Generate "
"the key again."
msgstr "公钥与本机的私钥不匹配。请重新生成密钥。"

msgid ""
"The public key shown here does not belong to the private key on this router. "
"Generate the key again, then add the new public key to the LAN machine."
msgstr ""
"此处显示的公钥与本机的私钥不匹配。请重新生成密钥，然后把新的公钥添加到局域网"
"主机。"

msgid "The public key was rebuilt from the private key. It is shown below."
msgstr "已根据私钥重新生成公钥，显示如下。"

msgid "The remote host key could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取远程主机密钥。"

msgid "The remote host key could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存远程主机密钥。"

msgid ""
"The remote host key has changed. If you did not expect that, stop and check "
"the machine."
msgstr "远程主机密钥已更改。如果这不是你预期的，请先停下并检查该机器。"

msgid "The remote host key has not been trusted yet."
msgstr "尚未信任远程主机密钥。"

msgid ""
"The remote host key is not trusted yet. Compare this fingerprint with the "
"remote machine before trusting it."
msgstr "尚未信任远程主机密钥。信任前请先与远程机器上的指纹进行比对。"

msgid "The remote host key is not trusted yet. Confirm the fingerprint below."
msgstr "尚未信任远程主机密钥。请在下方确认指纹。"

msgid "The remote host key is now trusted."
msgstr "现在已信任远程主机密钥。"

msgid ""
"The service name was the platform name. It is now fcc — change it if the "
"init script has another name."
msgstr ""
"服务名填写的是平台名称，现已改为 fcc——如果 init 脚本用别的名字，请改过来。"

msgid ""
"The service was not found on the LAN machine. Check the service name in "
"Advanced settings."
msgstr "在局域网主机上找不到该服务。请在高级设置中检查服务名称。"

msgid "The unusable SSH key could not be moved aside."
msgstr "无法把无法使用的 SSH 密钥移到一旁。"

msgid ""
"The unusable key was replaced. Add the public key below to the LAN machine."
msgstr "无法使用的密钥已被替换。请把下面的公钥添加到局域网主机。"

msgid "They take effect when you choose Save & Apply."
msgstr "选择“保存并应用”后生效。"

msgid "This log is empty."
msgstr "此日志为空。"

msgid "This router"
msgstr "本机"

msgid ""
"This router has no OpenSSH client. Install the openssh-client-utils package "
"on this router."
msgstr "本机没有 OpenSSH 客户端。请在本机安装 openssh-client-utils 软件包。"

msgid "This router has no setsid, so the LAN tunnel cannot be started."
msgstr "本机没有 setsid，无法启动局域网隧道。"

msgid ""
"This router is missing its SSH helper, so the LAN machine cannot be reached. "
"Reinstall luci-app-fcc."
msgstr "本机缺少 SSH 辅助脚本，无法连接局域网主机。请重新安装 luci-app-fcc。"

msgid ""
"This router needs ssh-keygen to create the key (package openssh-keygen)."
msgstr "本机需要 ssh-keygen 才能生成密钥（软件包 openssh-keygen）。"

msgid ""
"This router needs ssh-keyscan to read the remote host key (package openssh-"
"client-utils)."
msgstr ""
"本机需要 ssh-keyscan 才能读取远程主机密钥（软件包 openssh-client-utils）。"

msgid "To upgrade luci-app-fcc itself, run on the router:"
msgstr "如需升级 luci-app-fcc 本身，请在路由器上执行："

msgid "Trust this host"
msgstr "信任此主机"

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

msgid "Uninstall completely"
msgstr "彻底卸载"

msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

msgid "Update FCC"
msgstr "更新 FCC"

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "更新"

msgid ""
"Updating reinstalls the FCC runtime from upstream. If a step fails, the "
"previous runtime is put back and your data is left in place."
msgstr ""
"更新会从上游重新安装 FCC。若更新失败，系统会恢复到原先版本，你的数据不会丢"
"失。"

msgid "Uptime"
msgstr "运行时间"

msgid ""
"Use the first line for a standard account and the second for an "
"administrator account. The second file must be writable only by "
"Administrators and SYSTEM. That machine must already be running OpenSSH "
"Server: add it under Settings → System → Optional features (or run the "
"OpenSSH MSI), set its sshd service to start automatically, and let inbound "
"TCP 22 through the firewall."
msgstr ""
"标准账号用第一行，管理员账号用第二行；第二个文件只能由 Administrators 和 "
"SYSTEM 写入。那台机器必须先装好并运行 OpenSSH 服务器：在「设置 → 系统 → 可选"
"功能」里添加 OpenSSH 服务器（或运行 OpenSSH 的 MSI 安装包），把 sshd 服务设为"
"自动启动，并在防火墙放行 22 端口的入站连接。"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "用户名"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Versions updated."
msgstr "版本已更新。"

msgid "View Log"
msgstr "查看日志"

msgid "Web Console"
msgstr "Web 控制台"

msgid ""
"Without an init script of that name the launcher is used instead, as on a "
"Linux machine without a unit."
msgstr "没有同名的 init 脚本时改用启动器，如同没有 unit 的 Linux 机器。"

msgid "available"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "core"
msgstr "核"

msgid "cores"
msgstr "核"

msgid "free"
msgstr "空闲"

msgid "healthy"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "installed"
msgstr "已安装"

msgid "listening"
msgstr "监听中"

msgid "not checked"
msgstr "未检查"

msgid "not installed"
msgstr "未安装"

msgid "not listening"
msgstr "未监听"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid ""
"ssh on this router is Dropbear, which cannot use these options. Install the "
"OpenSSH client (package openssh-client-utils) on the router."
msgstr ""
"本机的 ssh 是 Dropbear，不支持这些选项。请在本机安装 OpenSSH 客户端（软件包 "
"openssh-client-utils）。"

msgid ""
"ssh on this router is not a usable OpenSSH client. Install the OpenSSH "
"client (package openssh-client-utils) on the router; the client on the "
"remote machine is not used."
msgstr ""
"本机的 ssh 不是可用的 OpenSSH 客户端。请在本机安装 OpenSSH 客户端（软件包 "
"openssh-client-utils）；远程电脑上的客户端不会被使用。"

msgid "the machine did not answer"
msgstr "对端主机没有响应"

msgid "unhealthy"
msgstr "异常"

msgid "up to date"
msgstr "已是最新"

msgid "update available"
msgstr "有可用更新"

msgid "uptime"
msgstr "运行时间"

msgid ""
"⚠️ Note: avoid choosing “All agents” when installing. It triggers a large "
"download, makes progress slow and takes about 8 GB of storage. Choose only "
"the items you need and install them in batches."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ 注意：安装时请避免选择“全部智能体”。这会触发大量下载导致进度缓慢，并占用约 "
"8 GB 存储空间。建议只选择您需要的项分批安装。"

#~ msgid "One-time setup on the LAN machine"
#~ msgstr "局域网主机的一次性准备"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The FCC Server did not start on the LAN machine. Its log on that machine, "
#~ "~/.fcc/server.log, says why."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "局域网主机上的 FCC Server 未能启动。该主机上的日志 ~/.fcc/server.log 会说"
#~ "明原因。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "macOS has no fcc service: start the FCC server on that machine itself."
#~ msgstr "macOS 上没有 fcc 服务：请在那台机器上直接启动 FCC Server。"

#~ msgid "Clear install record"
#~ msgstr "清除安装记录"

#~ msgid "Re-detect versions"
#~ msgstr "重新检测版本"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Update the FCC runtime now? The server is stopped during the update and "
#~ "your data is kept."
#~ msgstr "现在更新 FCC 运行时？更新期间服务器将停止，你的数据会被保留。"

#~ msgid "Refresh"
#~ msgstr "刷新"

#~ msgid "OpenSSH client is required (package openssh-client)"
#~ msgstr "需要 OpenSSH 客户端（软件包 openssh-client）"

#~ msgid "Reinstall"
#~ msgstr "重新安装"

#~ msgid "Uninstall and remove all data"
#~ msgstr "卸载并清除所有数据"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An install deletes the rollback copy it made as soon as it ends: on "
#~ "success it is no longer needed, and on failure it has just been used to "
#~ "put the previous runtime back. Only a rollback that could not complete "
#~ "leaves a copy behind, under the backup path."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "安装一旦结束就会删除它生成的回滚副本：安装成功时不再需要，安装失败时刚用它"
#~ "恢复了上一版运行时。只有在回滚未能完成时才会留下一份副本，位于备份路径下。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Choose a single agent to install just that one. The upstream installer "
#~ "stops at the first agent it cannot install and rolls the whole run back, "
#~ "so this is how the agents that work on this device are installed when one "
#~ "of them does not."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "选择单个智能体则只安装该智能体。上游安装器一旦遇到装不上的智能体就会停止并"
#~ "回滚整轮安装，因此当某个智能体在这台设备上装不了时，可用这种方式逐个安装其"
#~ "余能装上的智能体。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Install downloads the FCC runtime and the agents you choose — every agent "
#~ "in the registry by default. This can take several minutes on a router; "
#~ "progress is shown below."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "安装 FCC 会下载你所选择的智能体——默认是注册表中的全部智能体。在路由器上这"
#~ "可能需要数分钟；进度显示在下方。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Reinstall removes the runtime and installs it again with every agent, "
#~ "keeping your configuration and data. Use it when an install is incomplete "
#~ "or an agent is broken: the upstream installer does not reinstall an agent "
#~ "that is already present, so nothing short of this will."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "重新安装会先移除运行中的智能体，并保留你的配置和数据。当某次安装不完整或某"
#~ "个智能体损坏时可使用备份配置恢复：上游安装器不会重新安装已存在的智能体，因"
#~ "此只有这样做才能重装。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Uninstall removes the runtime and the agents but keeps your configuration "
#~ "under the install path, so a later install finds it again. Uninstall and "
#~ "remove all data also deletes that configuration and every saved backup; "
#~ "there is no undo."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "卸载会移除运行中的智能体，但保留安装路径下的配置，以便日后重新安装时自动沿"
#~ "用。卸载并清除所有数据会删除所有配置，包括已保存的备份，且无法撤销。"

#~ msgid "Clean up finished sessions"
#~ msgstr "清理已结束的会话"

#~ msgid "Delete backups"
#~ msgstr "删除备份"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Delete backups removes the copies an install sets aside — the previous "
#~ "runtime, and your data as it was before the install — and nothing else. "
#~ "They are what a failed install is rolled back to, so the button is "
#~ "refused while an install or update is running."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "删除备份会移除安装时保留的副本——上一版运行时，以及安装前的数据——不会影响其"
#~ "他内容。这些副本用于安装失败时的回滚，因此安装或更新进行期间该按钮会被拒"
#~ "绝。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Delete the saved backups? The runtime, the agents and your configuration "
#~ "are kept; every backup is removed. It cannot be undone."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "删除已保存的备份？运行时、智能体和配置都会保留，但所有备份将被删除。此操作"
#~ "无法撤销。"

#~ msgid "Actions"
#~ msgstr "操作"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Address the FCC server listens on. Keep 127.0.0.1 unless you need to "
#~ "reach the FCC Admin page from another device on your LAN. This router's "
#~ "own LAN address is the safest choice — binding to a specific address "
#~ "needs no firewall change. Binding to 0.0.0.0 adds a LAN-only firewall "
#~ "rule, and the port is never opened to the WAN."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "FCC 服务器监听的地址。除非需要从局域网内的其他设备访问 FCC Admin 页面，否"
#~ "则请保持 127.0.0.1。最安全的选择是本机自己的局域网地址——绑定到具体地址无需"
#~ "修改防火墙。绑定到 0.0.0.0 会添加一条仅限局域网的防火墙规则，该端口绝不会"
#~ "对 WAN 开放。"

#~ msgid "Close its session first."
#~ msgstr "请先关闭其会话。"

